  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">RtF &#x2013; UTTARAN</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The overall goal of UTTARAN as RtF hub is to promote locally led actions for sustainable and inclusive landscape and water management, and to enhance the resilience of community and ecosystem to climate change impacts.The hub supports 8 landscapes and communities in the Assasuni, Sathkira Sadar and Tala Upazila in the Sthkira district, southwestern Bangladesh. Those landscapes and communities are disproportionately affected by emerging climate-induced socio-economic and environmental crisis.</narrative>
  </description>
